We can write
\[f(x) = \sqrt{(x - 7)^2 + 3^2} - \sqrt{x^2 + 4}.\]Let $P = (x,0),$ $A = (7,3),$ and $B = (0,2).$  Then $f(x) = PA - PB.$

[asy]
